			<name>2601 San Pablo Ave · 223 units · In Review</name>
			<visibility>0</visibility>
			<description><![CDATA[<b>2601 SAN PABLO Ave</b><br/><b>Units:</b> 223<br/><b>VLI Units:</b> 0<br/><b>Stories:</b> 8<br/><b>Height:</b> 28.0m<br/><b>Status:</b> Under Construction<br/><i>Footprint 18,706 sf from the project's own Tabulation Form 1.E (2023-06-09), PROPOSED column: 8 storeys, 65% lot coverage, 129,658 sf gross floor area. Column identified by two independent checks - it is the only one matching v2's 8 storeys, and its 581 sf per unit across 223 units is the only plausible figure (the existing column gives 49, the permitted-maximum column 386). REPLACES a 3,668 sf polygon that gave 132 sf per unit. MULTI-PARCEL ASSEMBLY: 18,706 sf at 65% implies a 28,778 sf lot against a single county parcel of 3,669 sf, so the footprint spans several lots and the extent here is approximate; area is the architect's own.</i>]]></description>
